<title>UK: Metro Finance sets 100 mln Swiss franc 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>Metro Finance sets 100 mln Swiss franc 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METRO FINANCE BV AMSTERDAM</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.00	MATURITY    12.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.35    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> EOS	  12.MAR.97 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND =</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
